# The debug APK has this deployment's live credentials baked into it by
# :app:generateDefaults. Anything holding the file can read this Canvas account
# and spend the configured model subscription, so it is built locally and never
# committed. Earlier revisions of it in history predate the bundling and hold
# nothing.
Canvas-XP3-debug.apk
Canvas-XP3-release.apk
# Copies built before the rename to Canvas carry the same credentials.
Todo-XP3-debug.apk
Todo-XP3-release.apk
claude-token.txt
claude-auth.json

*.class
bin/
